    [
      "How do I care for brass and copper homeware?",
      "Gently polish with a soft cloth and mild soap. Avoid harsh chemicals and abrasive materials. Copper may develop a natural patina over time, which is part of its authentic character.",
    ],
    [
      "Are NLI Collections products suitable for gifting?",
      "Absolutely. Our pieces are beautifully crafted and packaged, making them ideal for weddings, festivals, housewarmings and corporate gifting. Personalisation options are available on request.",
    ],
    [
