              <h2 className="font-serif font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl text-charcoal leading-tight">
                Meaningful Gifting
              </h2>
              <p className="text-charcoal/70 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Celebrate life's special moments with handcrafted brass and copper gifts.
                From wedding presents to corporate souvenirs, our gifting collections
                are designed to create lasting impressions. Personalisation available
                on request for corporate and bulk orders.
              </p>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <Link
                  href="/collections/copper-gift-sets"
                  className="bg-white text-clay px-4 py-2 rounded text-sm font-medium"
                >
