      {/* =====================================================
         CRAFTsmanship AND MATERIAL QUALITY
         ===================================================== */}
      <section className="section bg-charcoal py-24 md:py-32">
        <div className="container-x max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
          <div className="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
            <h2 className="font-serif font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl text-cream mb-8 leading-tight">
              Our Craftsmanship
            </h2>
            <div className="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-left">
              <div>
                <h3 className="font-serif font-semibold text-white mb-3">
                  Hand-Hammering
                </h3>
                <p className="text-charcoal/40 text-sm">
                  Each piece is shaped on traditional anvils, hammered to achieve the
                  perfect thickness and finish.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 className="font-serif font-semibold text-white mb-3">
                  Traditional Techniques
                </h3>
                <p className="text-charcoal/40 text-sm">
                  Artisans use methods passed down through generations, adapted for
                  contemporary homes.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 className="font-serif font-semibold text-white mb-3">
                  Quality Finishing
                </h3>
                <p className="text-charcoal/40 text-sm">
                  Polished, matte, antique and hand-rubbed finishes that highlight the
                  natural beauty of brass and copper.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 className="font-serif font-semibold text-white mb-3">
                  Material Authenticity
                </h3>
                <p className="text-charcoal/40 text-sm">
                  Genuine brass and copper, sourced and finished to NLI Collections
                  standards.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* =====================================================
         PRODUCT CARE GUIDE
         ===================================================== */}
      <section className="section bg-cream py-24 md:py-32">
        <div className="container-x max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
          <div className="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
            <h2 className="font-serif font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl text-charcoal mb-6 leading-tight">
              Product Care Guide
            </h2>
            <p className="text-charcoal/70 mb-8">
              To keep your brass and copper pieces looking their best, gently polish
              with a soft cloth and mild soap. Avoid harsh chemicals and abrasive
              materials. Copper may develop a natural patina over time, which is
              part of its authentic character. Store in a dry place when not in
              use.
            </p>
            <div className="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
              <div>
                <h3 className="font-serif font-semibold text-charcoal mb-3">Brass Care</h3>
                <ul className="list-disc list-inside text-charcoal/70">
                  <li>Gently polish with a soft cloth and mild soap</li>
                  <li>Avoid harsh chemicals and abrasive materials</li>
                  <li>Store in a dry place when not in use</li>
                  <li>Natural patina development is normal and authentic</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 className="font-serif font-semibold text-charcoal mb-3">
                  Copper Care
                </h3>
                <ul className="list-disc list-inside text-charcoal/70">
                  <li>Clean with lemon salt or gentle copper cleaner for shine</li>
                  <li>Developing patina is part of copper's authentic character</li>
                  <li>Avoid acidic foods unlined copper for extended periods</li>
                  <li>Hand wash recommended</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

